e=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span><a href target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">https://gradservice.tsinghua.edu.cn/#/studentlogin</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">”</font></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">申请</font></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:9.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">3<font face=\"宋体\">、</font></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">人员范围：</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">202</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">6</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">年</font>6<font face=\"宋体\">月的毕业生</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">不含本科定向生、已校内推研本科生及研究生（军工、航空、兵器、兵总）定向生</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:9.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">4<font face=\"宋体\">、</font></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">领取方式：</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:4.5000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">1) </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">EMS</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">快递</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">到付</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">：请准确填写收件人信息；目前提供的邮寄服务为</font></span></span></span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">到付方式</font></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">，邮寄范围</font></span></span></span><b><u><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><font face=\"宋体\">只限中国大陆</font></span></span></span></span></span></u></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:4.5000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">2) <font face=\"宋体\">自取</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">或代领</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">：请按预约系统通知的时间，到注册中心（</font>C<font face=\"宋体\">楼</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">201</font><font face=\"宋体\">）取件</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:9.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">5<font face=\"宋体\">、</font></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">付费方式及标准：扫码付费</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">     <font face=\"宋体\">证书制作件：翻译费</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">20</font><font face=\"宋体\">元</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">每证每次，制作费</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\">元</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">每证每份</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">     <font face=\"宋体\">中英成绩单：中文</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">10</font><font face=\"宋体\">元</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">份，英文</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">10</font><font face=\"宋体\">元</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">/</font><font face=\"宋体\">份</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">     <font face=\"宋体\">排名证明：免费</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><font face=\"宋体\">备注：</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><font face=\"宋体\">本科生辅修学位成绩单与一学位成绩单同时提供，无需单独预约。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">二、封装类型</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">  <font face=\"宋体\">本、研一学位</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">    <font face=\"宋体\">类型</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">（英文）：毕业证书</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">学位证书</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">成绩单，上述材料各一份</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">                 <font face=\"宋体\">可选择加排名证明｛</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">15</font><font face=\"宋体\">级（含）之后｝</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">    <font face=\"宋体\">类型</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">（英文</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">中文）：毕业证书</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">学位证书</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">成绩单，上述材料各一份</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">                 <font face=\"宋体\">可选择加排名证明｛</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">15</font><font face=\"宋体\">级（含）之后｝</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">  <font face=\"宋体\">本科二学位、辅修证</font></span></span></span></span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">书制作件</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">    <font face=\"宋体\">类型</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">1</font><font face=\"宋体\">（英文）：二学位证书（或辅修证书）</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">成绩单，上述材料各一份</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">    <font face=\"宋体\">类型</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">2</font><font face=\"宋体\">（英文</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">中文）：二学位证书（或辅修证书）</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\">成绩单，上述材料各一份</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"宋体\">备注：</font></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:15.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:等线\">   <span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"宋体\">研究生如需办理本科</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:9.0